Audio and voice
---------------
Generated by scripts/gen-music.mjs and scripts/gen-vo.mjs via the ElevenLabs
API from original prompts committed in those scripts. Redistribution of the
rendered MP3 pack follows ElevenLabs' then-current terms for generated
content. If you cannot ship the MP3s, re-run the scripts with your own
ELEVENLABS_API_KEY. Prompts name no artist.

